    <comp lib="9" loc="(60,56)" name="Text">
      <a name="text" val='1) Decoder 5-&gt;32 bien opcode[6:2] thanh 1 duong "one-hot" cho moi nhom lenh (chi bat khi opcode[1:0]=11)'/>
